  "content": "<h2><u><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/275/578/2020-01-13_20.png\" alt=\"植物魔法種子\" width=\"600\" height=\"345\"></u></h2><h2><u>工業農業擴充模組</u></h2><p>這是工業農業模組的擴充，用於新增植物魔法的作物。<br> 此模組需要核心模組，可在此處找到：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/industrial-agriculture\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊</a></p><h3><u>新增的種子：<br></u></h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>活石</li>\n<li>活木</li>\n<li>魔力鋼</li>\n<li>精靈鋼</li>\n<li>泰拉鋼</li>\n<li>蓋亞之靈</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252farrow\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"114\"></a></p>",
